                "text": "<p>We chose Assam, India and Kericho, Kenya deliberately — one gives the malty depth chai needs, the other gives it the structure to stand up to milk and spice. The masala blend is whole-spice, hand-mixed here in Portland, batch by batch. No shortcuts, no fillers, no dilution for scale.</p>",
