                "text": "<p>He'd grown up in Mumbai and was doing his master's here. One afternoon he said: <em>“Man, I'm craving chai, and there's nowhere I can get it.”</em></p><p>That was the call to action. What I still didn't have was the reason. I loved that chai was ours — but that on its own isn't a reason to build a company.</p>",
